sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant UI as HRMS Web
    participant SettingSvc as Setting Service
    participant DB as Setting DB
    participant AuthSvc as Authorization Service
    participant DirectorySvc as Directory Service
    participant Kafka as Kafka

    Admin->>UI: Activate Company
    UI->>SettingSvc: Activate Company

    SettingSvc->>DB: Load Company
    SettingSvc->>DB: Validate Company Information
    SettingSvc->>DB: Validate Location setup
    SettingSvc->>DB: Validate Department setup
    SettingSvc->>DB: Validate Grade setup
    SettingSvc->>DB: Validate Job Title setup

    SettingSvc->>AuthSvc: Validate Role setup
    AuthSvc-->>SettingSvc: Completion status

    SettingSvc->>DirectorySvc: Validate Employee import
    DirectorySvc-->>SettingSvc: Completion status

    SettingSvc->>DB: Validate Responsibility / PoC setup

    alt Any mandatory step incomplete
        SettingSvc-->>UI: Reject activation<br/>return incomplete steps
        UI-->>Admin: Display blocking setup steps
    else All steps complete
        SettingSvc->>DB: BEGIN
        SettingSvc->>DB: Company PENDING -> ACTIVE
        SettingSvc->>DB: Write activation audit/outbox
        SettingSvc->>DB: COMMIT

        SettingSvc->>Kafka: company.activated

        SettingSvc-->>UI: Activation successful
        UI-->>Admin: Company Active
    end